  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPM-FPFK Ubunifu Youth Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to help young people develop useful skills and access opportunities to engage in social and economic development. Specifically the project seeks to help youth earn a living wage and cultivate a sense of responsibility, identity, creativity and hope. The project will build on the youth abilities that can benefit them and others in a creative way.</narrative>
  </description>
